{"asset_key":"ep5/herohub_story_15411160","episode":"ep5","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"15411160","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1541116001:1":{"text":"今、ホーリンは食糧難だからな。司令官の俺でも、十分な食事を振る舞うことができないんだ。","source_cn":"如今呼临食物紧缺，即便是我，也没有足够的食物招待你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89E1A2C12A4FFA1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1541116002:1":{"text":"気にしないでください。あなた方のせいではないのですから。","source_cn":"无需在意，这绝非你们的过错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFADC13F6390A1DBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1541116003:1":{"text":"ですが、有名なホーリンのリーフパイが食べられないのは少し残念ですね。","source_cn":"只是，没能品尝到远近闻名的呼临叶饼，的确令人遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04518AA7F3E0FBC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1541116003":{"text":"ですが、有名なホーリンのリーフパイが食べられないのは少し残念ですね。","source_cn":"只是，没能品尝到远近闻名的呼临叶饼，的确令人遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04518AA7F3E0FBC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1541116004:1":{"text":"リーフパイはホーリンの名産なんだ。この辺で言えば、一番有名なのがトータス町の小麦で、その次がリーフパイだな。","source_cn":"叶饼是呼临的特产。在周围所有城邦里，最出名的除了图塔镇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA0C2C568EB1D94F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1541116005:1":{"text":"名前に「リーフ」とあるが、別に葉っぱを使っているわけではない。","source_cn":"别听它名叫叶饼，但其实，和很多人以为的树叶没有关系。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x445FBECDB833A0A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1541116006:1":{"text":"リーフパイは、何種類もの緑色野菜を磨り潰して、それを生地に混ぜ込んで作るんだ。ホーリンではそれを葉っぱの形にして焼き上げるから、そう呼ばれている。","source_cn":"实际上，叶饼是用许多种绿色蔬菜碾碎后的残渣和汁液，混进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5EDA7C492EC9E419","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1541116007:1":{"text":"味は甘くて、香りがとても濃厚だ。リーフパイを売っている屋台の前を通り過ぎただけで、野菜と麦のいい香りがするんだ……","source_cn":"叶饼的味道非常甜，而且气味浓郁。即使只是路过售卖叶饼的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E436EED529F83AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1541116008:1":{"text":"だが今は……野菜や小麦どころか、ホーリンではもう雑草一本も生えてこない……","source_cn":"可是现在……别说蔬菜和小麦，呼临已经连一根野草都种不出来了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25F79EF4E05AAFBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1541116009:1":{"text":"畑で虫を追いかけ、麦を植えていた子ども時代の思い出が……まるで夢のようだよ。","source_cn":"回想我的童年，在田里捉虫、播撒麦种……仿佛梦一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA3EE8AA3C355E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1541116009":{"text":"畑で虫を追いかけ、麦を植えていた子ども時代の思い出が……まるで夢のようだよ。","source_cn":"回想我的童年，在田里捉虫、播撒麦种……仿佛梦一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDAA3EE8AA3C355E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1541116010:1":{"text":"ああ、一番美しい思い出だよ。","source_cn":"没错。那是我心中最美好的记忆。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF35F570AD18D35","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1541116011:1":{"text":"堕神の呪いを解けば、ホーリンは必ず元の姿に戻ります。私を信じてください。","source_cn":"请相信我，珀尔修斯。清除堕神诅咒之后，呼临将恢复它原本...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8932F5EEF8BF59D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1541116012:1":{"text":"かつての栄光も名誉も、再び戻って来ますよ。","source_cn":"它曾拥有的光辉和美名，都将再度伴随它。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27F54AE4C7D9ECA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1541116013:1":{"text":"……そうだといいな。","source_cn":"……希望如此。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CFB94832ECD7F7B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_s